    "chunk_text": "Godes ege is se frume wisedom. \u00de\u00e6t is swy\u00f0e mycel w\u00e6rscipe wi\u00f0 synnen, \u00fe\u00e6t him \u00e6lc mann simle Godes andweardnysse ondr\u00e6de. Se \u00fee fulfremedlice him God ondr\u00e6de\u00f0, he hine sylfne swy\u00f0e geornlice wi\u00f0 synne healde\u00f0. \u00dea m\u00e6nn, \u00fee heom God ondr\u00e6de\u00f0, by\u00f0 on \u00fean ytemesten d\u00e6ige swy\u00f0e wel, & heora mede wune\u00f0 on Se \u00fee him scamige, \u00fe\u00e6t he beforen mannen egen synegie, swy\u00f0er him sceal scamigen, \u00fe\u00e6t he beforen God \u00fea weorc ne gesceawe\u00f0, ac \u00fea inwearda heorta. \u00dea \u00fea mid \u00fean halgen ege heom God ondr\u00e6de\u00f0, heo simle sece\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t Gode lice\u00f0. O\u00f0er by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re bearne ege, o\u00f0er by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re \u00feeowen. \u00dea \u00feeowwes heom ondr\u00e6de\u00f0 heora hlafordes for wite, \u00fea bearn heom ondr\u00e6de\u00f0 heora f\u00e6deres for Nu we Godes bearn synden geceigde, ondr\u00e6de we us hine of \u00fe\u00e6re so\u00f0e lufe swetnysse, na of \u00fe\u00e6s eges Se wise mann on eallan his weorcan he him God ondr\u00e6de\u00f0, & he ge\u00f0\u00e6nce\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes & eft he cw\u00e6\u00f0, ne fram eastd\u00e6le, ne fram westd\u00e6le ne opene\u00f0 nane stowe God on to befleone. Se \u00fee him God ondr\u00e6de\u00f0, he onfoh\u00f0 his lare, se \u00fee waca\u00f0 on Godes beboden, he gemete\u00f0 ece Eadig by\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mannes sawle, \u00fee him God ondr\u00e6de\u00f0, & heo wune\u00f0 gesund fram \u00fe\u00e6re deofollice Eadig by\u00f0 se",
